  "label": "indignant moral judgment",
  "description": "The emotion expressed is one of moral outrage or indignation, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the elderly woman's impoverished appearance with the accusatory text implying dishonesty. The visual of a vulnerable person is used to evoke pity, which is then subverted by the text to provoke a sense of moral disapproval or anger at the perceived deceit.",
